10. Organ function levels must meet the requirements without transfusion, albumin, colony-stimulating factors, any cell growth factors, and/or platelet-raising drugs within 14 days before the first dose of the study drug;
11. Coagulation function: International Normalized Ratio (INR) ≤1.5, and activated partial thromboplastin time (APTT) ≤1.5 × ULN;
