4. The subjects had been receiving diet control and exercise therapy for 3 months before the first screening (visit 1), and had not received systematic treatment for diabetes during this period (the cumulative use of hypoglycemic drugs in recent 3 months was not more than 2 weeks, and no hypoglycemic drugs were used in recent 1 month);
